{"id":"630995","name":"脆皮黄瓜条","author":"沐祠姐姐","authorId":"12934813","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630995/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜大蒜子","amount":"少许"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"少许"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"少许"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"陈醋","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄瓜备用。","img":"images/630995/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄瓜切成长条把芯片另外切下来。","img":"images/630995/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入食盐。","img":"images/630995/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盖好保鲜膜放入冰箱冷藏半小时以上，口感更脆。","img":"images/630995/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小米椒生姜大蒜子切碎末。","img":"images/630995/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入碗中加入陈醋。","img":"images/630995/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"生抽，白糖，蚝油，芝麻。","img":"images/630995/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入热油。","img":"images/630995/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"料汁加入黄瓜里。","img":"images/630995/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌均匀就可以了，脆皮黄瓜就好了。","img":"images/630995/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/630995/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/630995/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}